# The Irencrag: "Whenever a legendary creature you control enters, you may have The Irencrag become a legendary Equipment
# artifact named Everflame, Heroes' Legacy. If you do, it gains equip {3} and 'Equipped creature gets +3/+3' and loses all
# other abilities." Aunt May, a legendary creature, enters on turn 1 and Bot1 accepts: the permanent is named Everflame,
# Heroes' Legacy and nothing else (CR 612.8), a legendary Artifact - Equipment (layer 4), and its {T}: Add {C} is gone
# (layer 6: "loses all other abilities"). It lasts (the ruling: no duration), so on turn 3 Bot1 pays the equip {3} it
# gained (Plains, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet) and Aunt May, a 0/2, gets +3/+3 from the ability it gave the Equipment: a 3/5.

